{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Do not go down to Egypt.</b> Let not the lack of pasture here induce you to go there, as in כִּי אֵין מִרְעֶה לַצֹּאן אֲשֶׁר לַעֲבָדֶיךָ וְכוּ' (Genesis 47:4)." "<b>Dwell in the land which I tell you.</b> Make shepherds' enclosures for your flocks in that very place which I tell you to sojourn in, for there your flocks too will prosper. This is because the reason he intended to leave was indeed the lack of pasture."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:47.732543892Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}